{
  "dom_id": "step-q76342",
  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "Find the characteristic equation of the matrix $M=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3} & \\sqrt{7} \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we find the matrix $\\,M-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nM-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3}-\\lambda  & \\sqrt{7} \\\\ 0 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThen, the characteristic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3}-\\lambda  & \\sqrt{7} \\\\ 0 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (\\sqrt{3}-\\lambda )(1-\\lambda )-0\\cdot \\sqrt{7} & =0 \\\\ (\\sqrt{3}-\\lambda )(1-\\lambda ) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
